  {
    num: '10',
    question: 'Is TeraWala completely free?',
    paragraphs: [
      'Yes, TeraWala is 100% free with unlimited link validations, video previews, and high-speed downloads. We do not require accounts, credit cards, or subscription fees.'
    ]
